<title>MAURITIUS: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>MAURITIUS GOVERNMENT LIST (961128)</p>
<p>*************************************************************</p>
<p>* 27 Nov 96 - Prime Minister Ramgoolam named a new finance  *</p>
<p>*		 minister in a minor cabinet reshuffle.	  *</p>
<p>*		 Details of other appointments were not	  *</p>
<p>*		 immediately available.				*</p>
<p>*************************************************************</p>
<p> President (took office 1 Jul 92).................Cassam UTEEM</p>
<p>Vice President</p>
<p>    (took office 1 Jul 92).........Sir Rabindranath GHURBURRUN</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>GOVERNMENT (Approved 30 Dec 95)</p>
<p> Prime Minister (Sworn in 27 Dec 95)...........Navin RAMGOOLAM</p>
<p>(also Minister for Defence, Internal Security, Civil</p>
<p>Service Affairs)</p>
<p> Deputy Prime Minister...........................Paul BERENGER</p>
<p>(also Minister of Foreign Affairs &amp;</p>
<p>International &amp; Regional Cooperation)</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
